WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.207
A portfolio.

2
00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:04.247
A portfolio is a collection of an artist's work.

3
00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:11.001
It holds finished pieces, and also sketches, notes, photos and feedback, because they show how your ideas grew.

4
00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:12.816
Check the goal.

5
00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:14.880
Every piece was made for a goal.

6
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.359
To review it, remember what it was for, then ask: does it do that yet?

7
00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.026
If not yet, that tells you what to change next.

8
00:00:22.726 --> 00:00:24.166
Praise and a next step.

9
00:00:24.326 --> 00:00:25.766
Good feedback has two parts.

10
00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:28.666
Say what works, and say one thing to try next.

11
00:00:28.826 --> 00:00:31.426
Both must be about what is really in the work.

12
00:00:32.126 --> 00:00:33.520
Change one thing.

13
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.398
You do not need to start again.

14
00:00:35.558 --> 00:00:38.669
Keep what works, change one thing, and check if it worked.

15
00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:41.105
That is how artists make their work better.
